			"notes": "Hi! Since [25w41a, MC-22882](https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC/issues/MC-22882) has been patched! This mod will therefore no longer be required from 1.21.11+. This would therefore be the final version of this mod.\n\nIt has been a pleasure to work on this mod and I want to thank everyone who as used it ❤️ I hope it was useful while it lasted!\n\nIf you have any issues with past versions, I will do my best to fix them if you open an issue. I will still try to offer support to the mod\n\nThanks a lot! ❤️ ❤️ ❤️"
